# Place your dataset files here (CSV or Parquet)
#
# Supported formats:
# - .csv (comma-separated values)
# - .parquet (columnar storage format)
#
# The tabular tools will auto-discover files in this directory.
# Example datasets:
# - vgsales.csv (Video Game Sales)
# - titanic.csv (Titanic passenger data)
# - imdb_movies.csv (IMDB movie data)
